                <p>3. On 20 August 1973 the 40 Committee approved $1,000,000 to support opposition
                    political parties and private sector organizations during FY 1974. No response
                    has yet been received to a message sent to the Santiago Station asking the total
                    amount of funds obligated prior to the military coup of 11 September 1973.</p>
                <p>4. The total amount authorized by the 40 Committee approvals listed above is
                    $6,615,166, which is [<hi rendition="#italic">dollar amount not
                        declassified</hi>] more than the total given for funds broken down by
                    recipient. This is because some funds were not needed. [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >4½ lines not declassified</hi>]</p>
